addles Life and Forces at the very least. He could be Obrimos, Adamantine Arrow.<br /> <b>Dio Brando</b>: Vampire, of course, but what sort? Daeva fits, perhaps with some sort of Bloodline. The time-stopping powers of The World could perhaps be a special Bloodline Discipline.<br /> <b>Stand Users In General</b>: Hard to pin down. Ones that manifest as some sort of spirit punchman could be Geists, but a lot of Stand Powers also could be Magic or, given how some of the later ones are very esoteric, Contracts. (Of course, most JJBA characters could also be Exalted, but let's not get into that big bowl of drugs yet)<br /> <b>The Pillar Men</b>: Body-bending supervampires? Gangrel Elders with crazy-high Protean, obviously.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8026-beans","name":"Beans","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8026_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"472"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-20T17:56:41-07:00","id":711502,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/349384-think-of-fictional-characters-and-say-what-they-would-be-in-cofd?p=710400#post710400\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Abis Mal would be a rogue Aegis Kai Doru agent.</div> </div> </div> </div>Then what's Genie?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reacti