ge (Comedy), Fast Reflexes 2), Fleet of Foot 2, Hardy 3, Indomitable, Interdisciplinary Specialty (Chemistry, Lethal Gags, Mind Games), Iron Stamina 2, Iron Will, Living with Death 2, Morbid Fascination, Quick Draw (Blades, Pistols), Retainer 4 (Harley Quinn), Seizing the Edge, Shiv 2, Sleight of Hand, Style: Fast Talking 4, Style: Improvised Weaponry 2, Style: Light Weapons 2, Murder Expert, Style: Street Fighting 3, Staff 4 (Henchmen), Striking Looks 1 (Frightening), Untouchable, Vice-Ridden<br /> <br /> <b>Conviction:</b> 7 [Mirrors, pg.32-33]<br /> <b>Integrity:</b> 3<br /> <b>Willpower:</b> 10<br /> <br /> <b>Size:</b> 5<br /> <b>Initiative:</b> 10<br /> <b>Defense:</b> 6<br /> <b>Speed:</b> 13<br /> <b>Health:</b> 8<br /> <br /> <b>Condition: </b>Amnesia, Madness, Obsession (Batman, Crime), Notoriety<br /> <b>Talent: </b>Compelling Madness, Profiling<br /> <b>Frailty: </b>Intolerance for Chaos, Obvious Lunatic</span><br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1420009-the-artificer-s-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">The Artificer's Workshop</a> - A collection of Exalted Artifacts<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806809-curios-relics-and-tomes\" target=\"_blank\">Curios, Relics, and Tomes</a> - A collection of Relics (Cursed and Otherwise)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/793173-the-horror-show\" target=\"_blank\">The Horror Lab</a> - A collection of Beasts, Monsters and less definable things.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1128197-strange-places#post1128197\" target=\"_blank\">Strange Places</a> - A collection of Dark, Mysterious, and Wondrous Locations<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/