tps://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-17T17:36:55-07:00","id":933166,"title":"","content":"Sounds like a Beast.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9102-whw","name":"WHW","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9102_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2542"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-17T18:41:09-07:00","id":933190,"title":"","content":"So, the eponymous virus from Snow Crash...An Imperative run amok?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-18T07:37:38-07:00","id":933412,"title":"","content":"Smoke Monster (Lost)?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/641-ben-linus","name":"Ben Linus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"444"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-18T09:53:25-07:00","id":933458,"title":"","content":"I would say The Smoke Monster is likely a Demon. It was originally an angel sent by the God Machine to guard the island but it Fell when it became desperate to leave and get to the mainland. After John Locke dies, it takes his form as a Cover.<br /> <br /> On that note, I think that Jacob is an Angel tasked by the God Machine to find a new guardian for the island. Jacob's convoluted plan to bring all the potential candidates to the island at once by guiding their lives to get on Oceanic Flight 815 and cause the plane to crash on the Island is exactly the kind of thing the God-Machine would do.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11643-corax","name":"Corax","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"80"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-18T12:09:07-07:00","id":933515,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ben Linus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/349384-think-of-fictional-characters-and-say-what-they-would-be-in-cofd?p=933412#post933412\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Smoke Monster (Lost)?</div> </div> </div> </div>Qliphoth made from things left by Jacob when he become Archmaster - i.e. his brother.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-18T12:40:12-07:00","id":933531,"title":"","content":"I thought a spirit of Shadow Level 8 or 9 contaminated by the will and conscience of Jacob's brother. Which has several interdictions and at the end was lost to them in the last chapter miss the last, have to protect the island, losing all his powers.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/641-ben-linus","name":"Ben Linus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"444"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-18T12:42:35-07:00","id":933533,"title":"","content":"Goliath (Gargoyles)?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/641-ben-linus","name":"Ben Linus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"444"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-18T19:23:17-07:00","id":933696,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ben Linus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/349384-think-of-fictional-characters-and-say-what-they-would-be-in-cofd?p=933533#post933533\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Goliath (Gargoyles)?</div> </div> </div> </div>Gargoyles in general are kind of like Kindred with the whole nocturnal existence thing- the clan's circumstance of waking up in 90s Manhattan after a millennium could be a really compelling set-up for a Vampire game. <br /> <br /> But then you factor in all the True Fae shenanigans, and the fact that Changeling allows for a lot of customization, and the gargoyles could easily be some Seeming/Kith/Court combination of Lost. <br /> <br /> And then there's the fact that Beast is really emphasizing other mythical creatures that fall outside of the other splats, and you could say that they are all exceptionally benevolent Ugallu Nemeses who try to limit themselves to only terrorizing those who threaten them and theirs. <br /> <br /> Honestly, I think there's a reason why there was a fansplat for Gargoyles: its tone, theme, and character mechanics and abilities share certain elements with some of the splats, but not enough to have an obvious corollary, and is sufficiently its &quot;own thing&quot; that trying to do something like Gargoyles would require a custom-made splat. Besides, the gargoyles would stick out like sore thumbs in the Chronicles of Darkness- they are so lacking in inherit complications and personal tragedy- no need to drink blood or consume human flesh, no Paradox to worry about, no Wasteland or Disquiet, no emotional vampirism or paranoia, no God-Machine, no Devouring- that everybody else would probably resent them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-18T22:19:24-07:00","id":933735,"title":"","content":"The Gargoyles' inherent weakness is that they are only active at night; there's no way to avoid or push through the sleep, it doesn't matter if they're in direct sunlight or not, once sunrise comes they're stone with no way to defend themselves without human allies. In that respect they're like a mashup of vampires and mummies.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/747-knowbody","name":"Knowbody","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"391"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-19T06:23:06-07:00","id":933831,"title":"","content":"They have a slave mentality to always seek a master to serve. And that even the anti-humanity Demona had (the most independent of the Gargoyles).<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/641-ben-linus","name":"Ben Linus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"444"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-19T06:24:54-07:00","id":933833,"title":"","content":"Muta (This Island Earth)?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/641-ben-linus","name":"Ben Linus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"444"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-19T13:38:14-07:00","id":934058,"title":"","content":"<b>Maresh (Water Phoenix King)</b> is a Seer that follows Yamra, an... interpretation of The Raptor that's more about &quot;all Life in its place, with all else being a blasphemy&quot; than &quot;the strong prey on the weak&quot;. He has the Crown of Cultivation, which gives him the benefits of Life Armor vs. his lessers <i>in addition</i> to any other Mage Armor he has active (he likes to also use Life Armor. They stack), as well as the ability to spend Mana to force Down and Dirty against anyone who is his social inferior.<br /> <br /> He loves using Hone The Form to boost his Physical Attributes past the human maximum, and keeps up a nice, strong Body Control.<br /> <br /> =---=<br /> <br /> <b>Edit:</b> Or he's a Ghoul with a <i>bunch</i> of dots in Celerity, <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1MBCFIQTeX4arQMs7SumBoJtamuvjj39GkksRPOMyTio/edit\" target=\"_blank\">Praestantia</a>, Resilience, and Vigor. Like, we're talking probably 12+ dots <i>total</i>, plus 4 dots in Strength Performance. Dude tends to one-shot people.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":1170,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","user":"amechra","date":". 07-19-2016, 04:44 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-19T14:00:48-07:00","id":934072,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/349384-think-of-fictional-characters-and-say-what-they-would-be-in-cofd?p=933163#post933163\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Presently tapdancing back and forth on what the title character of <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Neuro:_Supernatural_Detective\" target=\"_blank\"><i>Neuro: Supernatural Detective</i></a> is.</div> </div> </div> </div> Perhaps he is some kind of Ugallu Collector who achieved his Incarnate Inheritance in an alternate universe, and is trying to figure out the true nature of the God-Machine. Those demon tools he has could be the part of his collection, and he probably has Kinship with Mages and Geniuses.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-19T15:08:10-07:00","id":934122,"title":"","content":"Johnny Turbo was a Demon trying to warn us about the God-Machine and I cannot be convinced otherwise.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-19T18:40:31-07:00","id":934231,"title":"","content":"Frank from Donnie Darko was an Angel who needed Donnie dead for a G-M plot.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-21T12:51:24-07:00","id":935211,"title":"","content":"The Grand Wizard of the Kingdom of Kuppa Keep would be like an Obrimos, only cooler","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12063-seta143","name":"Seta143","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-22T10:34:14-07:00","id":935674,"title":"","content":"- Aliens (The War of the Worlds)?<br /> - Aberrations created by Moreau?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/641-ben-linus","name":"Ben Linus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts: