r /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Long Term Aspiration:</b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Stigmata: </b>Stimming </span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Description:</b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Bio:</b></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1540,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","user":"Basic","date":". 11-26-2016, 04:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-03T12:43:16-07:00","id":997832,"title":"","content":"What would you make Frank Underwood and Elementary's Sherlock Holmes?<br /> Frank made me think Ventrue Invictus more than once, what with the focus on power and power structures. And I think I wouldn't give him Majesty (or at least, very little). More than once he forcefully makes people bow to his will, which feels more Dominate-ish to me. He is less &quot;like me&quot; and more &quot;you need me, now DO WHAT I SAY&quot;.<br /> <br /> Sherlock would make a fine Ugallu Nemesis if he went more often for the scaring routine, imo. However, the way he is, I propose something maybe a bit daring: a Wizened Changeling. Someone strangely obsessed with solving riddles, nimble and smart, he was taken by the Fae Moriarty. His Durance lasted for six months in the real world, and only through his superior perception and mind was he able to flee. There was no fetch left behind, and when he came back, he covered it up with a story about drug abuse and subsequent withdrawal.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8542-wormwood","name":"Wormwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8542_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-04T17:39:24-07:00","id":998517,"title":"","content":"<b><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Godzilla</span><br /> <br /> Virtue: </b>Courageous<br /> <b>Vice: </b>Wrathful<br /> <b>Aspirations:</b> Cause Destruction, Fight Other Monsters<br /> <br /> <b>Mental Attributes:</b> Intelligence 3, Wits 5, Resolve 9<br /> <b>Physical Attributes:</b> Strength 19, Dexterity 4, Stamina 19<br /> <b>Social Attributes:</b> Presence 7, Manipulation 2, Composure 7<br /> <br /> <b>Skills:</b> Investigation (Kaiju Weaknesses) 1, Athletics (Atomic Breath) 5, Brawl (Grappling) 6, Survival 3, Weaponry (Improvised) 3, Empathy 1, Intimidation (Roar) 6<br /> <br /> <b>Merits:</b> Danger Sense 2, Air Of Menace 2, Iron Will 2, Brute Force 4, Relentless Assault 3, Defensive Combat 1 (Brawl), Unarmed Defense 5<br /> <br /> <b>Health: </b>129 (Size 110)<br /> <b>Willpower:</b> 26<br /> <b>Defense:</b> 10 (+3 With Unarmed Defense)<br /> <b>Initiative:</b> 11<br /> <b>Speed: </b>123<br /> <b>Armor: </b>28<br /> <b>Potency:</b> 9<br /> <b>Dread Powers:</b> Breath Weapon*, Influence (Destruction 1). Fearless*, Fire Elemental, Madness And Terror, Numen (Awful Presence*, Weather Control* [Earthquake, Inferno]), <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/793173-the-horror-show?p=1076503#post1076503\"><b>Titanic</b></a>, Toxic 2, Unnatural Healing*<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Weapons/Attacks</b><br /> Natural Weaponry [+18L Melee; 26 dice]<br /> Atomic Breath [+18L or +20L Ranged; 25 dice, Range 400/800/1200]</span><br /> <br /> <b><i>*Awful Presence:</i> </b>Anyone who can directly perceive Godzilla who has less Willpower dots than his Potency suffers the effect of the Insensate Tilt for the rest of the scene, unless they succeed on a Resolve + Composure roll with a penalty equal to Godzilla's Potency/2 round up. Supernatural powers used to counter the Tilt, meanwhile, trigger a Clash of Wills, with Godzilla rolling Presence + Potency<br /> <br /> <i><b>*Breath Weapon: </b></i>Horrors with this Dread Power can command the elements to destroy their enemies, often literally breathing gouts of fire or hurling bolts of lightning. Choose the type of attack when this Dread Power is selected; this is typically an element such as acid, fire, lighting or cold, but other, more exotic elements might be used depending on the nature of the creature. By spending 1 point of Willpower, the Horror can blast individual targets in range (5/10/15) that counts as a ranged attack with a thrown weapon and requires a roll of an appropriate dice pool \u2013 the opponent\u2019s Defense. This attack has a weapon bonus of +0L. By expending 3 Willpower, the weapon bonus increases to +2L and inflicts the Burning Tilt. In Godzilla's case, the dice pool is Stamina + Athletics + Atomic Breath Specialty, and the Range is 400/800/1200.<br /> <br /> <i><b>*Fearless:</b></i> Godzilla's mindset does not recognize fear in most situations and he is immune to any fear causing supernatural phenomena. Likewise, any method of supernatural coercion that works on humans or animals automatically fails as well.<br /> <br /> <i><b>*Unnatural Healing:</b></i> Godzilla heals all bashing and lethal damage at the start of each turn.<br /> <br /> <i><b>*Weather Control:</b> </i>Typically possessed by entities of Rank 3+, this Numen allows the entity to summon a brief but powerful weather storm. The Numen costs 3 Essence to activate. If successful, the entity may impose an Environmental Tilt over an area with a radius of up to [Power x 100] yards until the end of the scene. This area is treated as an Intensity 2 Extreme Environment. An Exceptional Success creates an Intensity 3 Extreme Environment instead. The entity may use their Influence to further augment the weather storm\u2019s size, duration and Intensity (where appropriate). This Numen only creates one type of Environmental Tilt, but may be purchased multiple times.<br /> <br /> <br /> EDIT: Modified the stats to follow the Potency chart and included <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/775-reighnhell\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar775_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"775\" data-vbnamecard=\"775\">Reighnhell</a>'s Breath Weapon, Fearless and Titanic Dread Powers, and Amechra's Awful Presence.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":4443,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","user":"GibberingEloquence","date":". 07-01-2017, 04:20 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-05T16:12:37-07:00","id":998930,"title":"","content":"How about <a href=\"http://www.scp-wiki.net/drclef-member-page\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Dr. Alto Clef</b></a>? I'm thinking that he is an epic level Hunter who is also a Stigmatic. His stigmata is his head being replaced by random and strange things in pics and video, and he has a assortment of lesser Supernatural Merits, Embeds, Exploits, Implanted Gadgets, Endowments and special Conditions that explain all the weirdness that surrounds him. I thank <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar117