about the Elric brothers from <a href=\"https://myanimelist.net/anime/121/Fullmetal_Alchemist/characters\" target=\"_blank\"><i>Fullmetal Alchemist?</i></a></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Edward would be Moros mage or <b>Promethean</b> Alchemist. Alfonse would be Unlfeshed or Homunculus ( from Mage's <b>Tome of Mysteries</b> or Golem from 2E corebook )","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-09T05:55:16-08:00","id":1028987,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/349384-think-of-fictional-characters-and-say-what-they-would-be-in-cofd?p=1028894#post1028894\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Edward would be Moros mage or <b>Promethean</b> Alchemist. Alfonse would be Unlfeshed or Homunculus ( from Mage's <b>Tome of Mysteries</b> or Golem from 2E corebook )</div> </div> </div> </div>But isn't Alfonse still himself? I don't know FMA terribly well, but it seems more like hish consciousness was moved to the metal body, rather than the body being a new being of its own.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-09T06:25:31-08:00","id":1029009,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>malonkey1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/349384-think-of-fictional-characters-and-say-what-they-would-be-in-cofd?p=1028987#post1028987\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But isn't Alfonse still himself? I don't know FMA terribly well, but it seems more like hish consciousness was moved to the metal body, rather than the body being a new being of its own.</div> </div> </div> </div>From background he would be <b>Mage</b>'s Homunculus - artificial body with human ghosts inside. From his using Alchemy and trying to become real human once again - he seems more like Unfleshed with most memories of his previous id. There were even episode in anime that he question is he still Alfonse and not simply Alchemy animated armor that <i>thinks</i> is Alfonse.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 01-09-2017, 09:28 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-09T06:32:24-08:00","id":1029012,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/349384-think-of-fictional-characters-and-say-what-they-would-be-in-cofd?p=1029009#post1029009\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> From background he would be <b>Mage</b>'s Homunculus - artificial body with human ghosts inside. From his using Alchemy and trying to become real human once again - he seems more like Unfleshed with most memories of his previous id. There were even episode in anime that he question is he is still Alfonse and not simply Alchemy animated armor that <i>thinks</i> is still Alfonse.</div> </div> </div> </div>Within FMA's setting and theme, Alfonse's whole point was that he is in fact himself. The doubting episode was an enemy of his trying to screw with his mind. So he cannot be a ghost, which mages know damn for sure that they aren't the real person. Nor can he be a Promethean, because, well, you know.<br /> <br /> EDIT:<br /> I propose him being a completely new template altogether, loosely based on the Purified.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a hre