ing observed by one person only</div> </div> </div> </div>Image makes you perceptible to all material beings for the scene, but let's simply assume Bill Cipher can use it selectively.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-29T13:52:21-07:00","id":1109383,"title":"","content":"Just out of curiousity - What would you make Ainz Oool Gown from Overlord?<br /> <br /> And just because of some Anime lately: how about All Might from Boku no Hero Academia?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8542-wormwood","name":"Wormwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8542_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-29T14:09:59-07:00","id":1109392,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wormwood</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/349384-think-of-fictional-characters-and-say-what-they-would-be-in-cofd?p=1109383#post1109383\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just out of curiousity - What would you make Ainz Oool Gown from Overlord?<br /> <br /> And just because of some Anime lately: how about All Might from Boku no Hero Academia?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> All Might sounds like more of an Exalted honestly","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-30T05:15:42-07:00","id":1109702,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Master Aquatosic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/349384-think-of-fictional-characters-and-say-what-they-would-be-in-cofd?p=1109392#post1109392\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> All Might sounds like more of an Exalted honestly</div> </div> </div> </div>I guess you're right. I mean, I could imagine him as a sort of Beast Tyrant or Nemesis basically preying on criminals, and while that would maybe be able to reflect his actions, it certainly wouldn't fit his character. Like, at all.<br /> Exalted sounds fair game, though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8542-wormwood","name":"Wormwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8542_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-30T07:55:48-07:00","id":1109760,"title":"","content":"I know that we have a great writeup of Luffy as a Changeling, but I just realized: could he be a Werewolf? Hear me out. His favorite food is meat, and eating meat heals even stuff like broken teeth for him. Plus, there is his insane strength, durability and even the &quot;Voice of All Things&quot; could be the spirit language if you look at it funny. But mostly the meat thing","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-30T08:20:40-07:00","id":1109773,"title":"","content":"They have a fighting style that revolves around growing and shrinking really fast, too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-30T12:14:43-07:00","id":1109860,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Master Aquatosic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/349384-think-of-fictional-characters-and-say-what-they-would-be-in-cofd?p=1109760#post1109760\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I know that we have a great writeup of Luffy as a Changeling, but I just realized: could he be a Werewolf? Hear me out. His favorite food is meat, and eating meat heals even stuff like broken teeth for him. Plus, there is his insane strength, durability and even the &quot;Voice of All Things&quot; could be the spirit language if you look at it funny. But mostly the meat thing</div> </div> </div> </div>I like this idea. Not only that, but he also shows the same zeal for protecting his Nakama that a Werewolf would show for protecting his Pack. Uratha!Luffy's Pack is super weird and probably multi-splat, but I can see it working. Who would be the Totem, though? What about the Devil Fruit? Also, the original Luffy always spared his enemies. Uratha!Luffy would be different in the sense that he is willing to kill, but only does that when he thinks there's no other way.<br /> <br /> If you want an Uratha!Luffy, you can take <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/349384-think-of-fictional-characters-and-say-what-they-would-be-in-cofd?p=1011999#post1011999\"><b>my write up for the Changeling version</b></a> and do the following:<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">1) Remove Mask, Mien, Seeming and Kith. Add Auspice (Rahu), Tribe (Blood Talons), Blood (Challenger) and Bone (Guru).<br /> <br /> 2) Replace the Specialty for the Hedge with a Specialty for the Shadow.<br /> <br /> 3) Add the following Renowns: Cunning 3, Glory 4, Honor 4, Purity 5, Wisdom 2.<br /> <br /> 4) Remove Wyrd and Clarity: Add Primal Urge 7 and Harmony 6.<br /> <br /> 5) Replace Changeling specific Merits with the following Merits: Anchored 1 (Straw Hat Pirates), Blood Or Bone Affinity 5, Controlled Burn, Favored Form* (Dalu 3), Fortified Form (Dalu 5, Gauru 5), Living Weapon (Dalu 5, Gauru 5), Moon Kissed (Brawl, Survival), Pack Dynamics 5, Self Control, Weakest Link and Tactical Shifting 5.<br /> <br /> 6) Remove Contracts. Add the following Gifts, Facets and Rites:<br /> <br /> Full Moon (Killer Instinct, Warrior's Hide, Bloody Handed Hunter, Butchery, Crimson Spasm)<br /> Dominance (Primal Allure, Lead The Lesser Pack)<br /> Elementals (Flesh Of Earth, Tongue Of Flame)<br /> Insight (Prey On Weakness, Read The World's Loom, Scent The Unnatural)<br /> Inspiration (Fearless Hunter, Pack Triumphs Together, Unity, Still Small Voice)<br /> Nature (Pack Kin)<br /> Rage (Berserker's Might, Perfected Rage)<br /> Strength (Unchained, Preadtor's Unmatched Pursuit, Crushing Blow, Primal Strength, Rending Claws)<br /> Change (Father's Form, Quicksilver Flesh, Long Limbs*)<br /> Pack (Pack Awareness)<br /> Rites (Sacred Hunt, Twilight Purge, Forge Alliance, Banish, Shadowcall, Supplication, Hidden Path)<br /> <br /> *Luffy's Favored Form gives him Exceptional Success with 3 Success on Athletics, +1 Strength, and Exceptional Success with 3 Successes on the Long Limbs Facet.<br /> <br /> *Long Limbs (Facet Of The Gift Of Change, Wisdom)<br /> <br /> The Uratha's flesh extends like rubber to reach out toward distant targets.<br /> <br /> Cost: 1 Essence<br /> Dice Pool: Stamina + Athletics + Wisdom<br /> Action: Reflexive<br /> <br /> Dramatic Failure: The Uratha suffers 3 lethal damage and an appropriate Tilt, such as Leg Wrack or Arm Wrack.<br /> <br /> Failure: Nothing happens, but the Uratha may attempt to activate this Facet again with a cumulative -1 penalty.<br /> <br /> Success: The Uratha may extend her limbs, neck, torso and other body parts. In order words, she may make appropriate rolls at a distance, such as Brawl, Athletics, Larceny and Investigation, with the Ranges being [Wisdom x 10/Wisdom x 20/Wisdom x 40] in yards. She may bend her body p\u00e1rts around obstacles and corners to surprise, disarm or spy on foes, but doing so doubles the Range penalties. This lasts for a number of turns equal to Wisdom, but may be extended with additional Essence expenditure and no roll.<br /> <br /> Exceptional Success: The Facet lasts for the scene, and bending around corners and obstacles does not increase Range penalties.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":4443,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","user":"GibberingEloquence","date":". 06-30-2017, 03:21 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-01T11:28:14-07:00","id":1110276,"title":"","content":"Wilson Fisk (Netflix's Daredevil) strong-willed Ventrue Kingpin of New York who claims Hell's Kitchen as his Domain, member of the Invictus, Vanessa Mariana is his Touchstone","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12561-shawarbaaz","name":"Shawarbaaz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"467"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-01T11:30:19-07:00","id":1110277,"title":"","content":"I find Kingpin easiest to describe as a human, but you could also put him down as a Beast.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-01T11:40:04-07:00","