s his Domain, member of the Invictus, Vanessa Mariana is his Touchstone</div> </div> </div> </div>I actually see him as an Anakim Beast with either a Hunger for Ruin (he wants to tear Hell's Kitchen down brick by brick) or Power (so that he can remake it in his image).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-08T08:54:25-07:00","id":1113270,"title":"","content":"Hey, here's a property I am sure will cause confusion:<br /> <br /> La Capitan: Acanthus, last survivor of the Nameless pirates, on the basis her ship is a time-hopping Artifact.<br /> <br /> Chairman Pike: Elder vampire who prefers ghouls over other vampires. Allows him free run of his little slice of hell.<br /> <br /> Spite: Freak Slasher who later went Mutant after being experimented on by Pike, then came back as a revenant.<br /> <br /> Deadline: Powerful, ancient Sekhem sorcerer trying to complete his warding rite on the entire planet. Maybe his species' version of an Arisen.<br /> <br /> Miss Information: Started as a mortal with a unique supernatural Merit, later became a Scelesti Obrimos focusing on Prime after she went nuts(er).<br /> <br /> Gloomweaver: Archmaster Lich with a focus in Death and Fate Arcana.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbc