:"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","name":"ElvesofZion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1329_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-11T23:06:26-07:00","id":1114947,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>RickmanUK</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/349384-think-of-fictional-characters-and-say-what-they-would-be-in-cofd?p=1103489#post1103489\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> If everyone is singing the Same Song maybe... that is how he can Ascend. Maybe he's found a song that will allow him to &amp;quot;Unmake&amp;quot; something, and he's doing it to see if it works. If it does then Surely he's right.. and a song of Creation is real aswell. Maybe it's just a case of finding the right place to sing it so the whole city can hear it... if they can all hear it they all think it. Maybe its a form of Immortality he's after he needs supplies and he can perform multiple tasks at the same time by stealing stuff while also getting people to sing for him.<br /> <br /> Maybe it's the only way for him to Remain himself... a Deal with a Demon is not a good thing. And one doesn't want to fail their terms of the contract.</div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe he's trying to spread the One Song...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemp