his.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Austin Walker, COUNTER/Weight Episode 09: This Month of Ours</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Underneath the ice, something begins to move. Omen is digging furiously, and underneath there is something sharp and long and angular.<br /> <br /> And the ground underneath them shakes, and a form rises up around them. It\u2019s a humanoid shape. Omen is riding on the top of it as it rises up out of the big hole, to where it\u2019s as big as the hole is.<br /> <br /> <b>You know how a space shuttle has the thing it\u2019s, like, connected to? It\u2019s almost as if you\u2019d built that crane and arm and stuff and didn\u2019t realize you were already building that. And this thing rises up out of the snow and ice and reaches onto some metal plates that had been built there, and people didn\u2019t even realize they had been building that thing. <br /> <br /> And its shapes are long and angular, and its arms don\u2019t end in fists the way ours do, and I think Natalia, who at least has some of her mind, still, recognizes that this is a Divine. And it is <u>old</u>, it is <u>very</u> old. It is not <u>quite</u> like the Divines that you have seen or read about or heard or seen sense-videos of - unlike those, it doesn\u2019t seem to have the same\u2026 <br /> <br /> It doesn\u2019t feel <u>divine</u> in the same way. It <u>feels</u> man-made, but that doesn\u2019t make it any less horrifying.</b><br /> <br /> Omen slides down it into a cockpit, and inside you can see, in fact, the cockpit is like the cockpit of a Rigger, it has controls, it doesn\u2019t have the weird brain-jack. And it hums with energy and with heat, and the whole place begins to melt, minus the infrastructure that had been built already, but people just go sliding into the ice.<br /> <br /> There is a <u>booming</u> voice, that people hear in their heads, that\u2026 It\u2019s not a voice, actually, I think it\u2019s like, a booming\u2026 heh. I think the best thing it could be, is like, it feels like it\u2019s like a \u2014 it\u2019s like your ninety-day job evaluation, like your ninety-day review?<br /> <br /> You\u2019re being judged, and those who fall and die are those who did not work hard enough. Those who did not have the <u>rigour</u> necessary to impress their new boss.<br /> <br /> Their new boss, of course, is <u><b>Rigour, the First Divine</b></u>.</div> </div> </div> </div></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-20T16:59:51-07:00","id":1118760,"title":"","content":"