e spared). I could see the couple as a unique set of keepers who only take those that are deemed &quot;guilty&quot; and taken until they &quot;learn their lesson&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my DriveThruRPG books at: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Carrie%20Kube\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse....=Carrie%20Kube</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1834-yaoi-huntress-earth","name":"Yaoi Huntress Earth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1834_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"535"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-06T19:13:47-08:00","id":1365919,"title":"","content":"<b><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><i><u>Rick Sanchez (Rick &amp; Morty)</u></i></span><br /> <br /> Virtue:</b> Cunning<br /> <b>Vice:</b> Reckless/Spiteful<br /> <b>Catalyst:</b> Grimm (?)<br /> <b>Foundation:</b> Navigator<br /> <br /> <b>Mental Attributes:</b> Intelligence 5, Wits 4, Resolve 5<br /> <b>Physical Attributes:</b> Strength 2, Dexterity 3, Stamina 3<br /> <b>Social Attributes:</b> Presence 2, Manipulation 4, Composure 3<br /> <br /> <b>Skills:</b> Academics 3, Crafts (Robotics) 5, Computer (Artificial Intelligence) 5, Medicine (Genetic Engineering) 4, Occult (God-Machine) 3, Politics 2, Investigation (Deductive Reasoning) 3, Science (High Energy Physics) 5, Athletics (Chases) 3, Brawl 2, Drive (Spaceship) 4, Firearms (Portal Gun) 3, Larceny 2, Stealth 3, Survival 2, Weaponry 2, Expression (Wisecracking) 2, Intimidation 3, Persuasion 2, Streetwise 2, Subterfuge (Dirty Tricks) 4<br /> <br /> <b>Merits:</b> Common Sense, Professional Training 5 (Advanced 3, Scientist: Crafts, Science, Computers, Medicine), Trained Observer 3, Vice-Ridden, Automotive Genius, Crack Driver 3, Parkour 3, Stunt Driver 5, Closed Book 4, Contacts (Several), Iron Will, Resources 3, Retainer (Morty 3 [+Beholden Condition]), Laboratory (Garage Workshop), Table Turner, Untouchable<br /> <br /> <b>Genius Merits:</b> ST Fiat, Except Obligation And Science Hero<br /> <br /> <b>Health:</b> 8<br /> <b>Willpower:</b> 8<br /> <b>Defense:</b> 6<br /> <b>Initiative:</b> 6<br /> <b>Speed:</b> 10<br /> <b>Obligation:</b> 3<br /> <b>Primum:</b> 5<br /> <b>Conditions:</b> Activated Genius, You'll Pay For What You Did (Grimm), To Boldly Go (Navigator), Addiction (Alcohol), Notoriety (Everything), Unmada<br /> <br /> <b>Notes: </b>I am using my own version of the Genius Template, which you can find <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1eM6TJ-gB0i6FZFL2OXWNaoijDCZW7-Ry7_U-kNtK6X0/edit\" target=\"_blank\"><b>here.</b></a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":4443,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","user":"GibberingEloquence","date":". 07-13-2022, 02:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-23T13:22:56-07:00","id":1441115,"title":"","content":"Is this thread dead? If not Daphne Miller is a duel hunger Collecter/Tyrant beast.<br /> <br /> Also the cast of Daganronpa V3 are all Changlings","signature":"","edited":{"userid":23952,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","user":"Konradleijon","date":". 04-20-2021, 04:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-11T15:09:35-07:00","id":1478610,"title":"","content":"I actually made Perfect Cell (albeit much lower in power than in DBZ) in Deviant. Is anyone interested in seeing him?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":23983,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23983-xela_nut","user":"xela_nut","date":".  Clarity 04-11-2022, 06:16 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23983-xela_nut","name":"xela_nut","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23983_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"91"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-16T13:41:06-07:00","id":1478972,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>xela_nut</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/349384-think-of-fictional-characters-and-say-what-they-would-be-in-cofd?p=1478610#post1478610\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I actually made Perfect Cell (albeit much lower in power than in DBZ) in Deviant. Is anyone interested in seeing him?</div> </div> </div> </div>I am, please post it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-26T07:06:25-07:00","id":1481994,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lbeaumanior</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/349384-think-of-fictional-characters-and-say-what-they-would-be-in-cofd?p=1478972#post1478972\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I am, please post it.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Sorry this took me a REALLY long time. I got caught up in real life stuff, which ended up taking a lot. But here it is now:<br /> Name: Perfect Cell.<br /> Concept: Perfect Bio Android.<br /> Threat level is assumed to be 3 for starting character creation.<br /> Intelligence: 3. Strength: 5. Presence: 5.<br /> Wits: 5. Dexterity: 5. Manipulation: 2.<br /> Resolve: 4. Endurance: 5. Composure: 4.<br /> Crafts: 1.<br /> Medicine: 2.<br /> Occult (Divergence): 2.<br /> Science: 2.<br /> Athletics: 5.<br /> Brawl (Kung Fu): 5.<br /> Stealth: 3.<br /> Survival (Hunting): 3.<br /> Animal Ken: 2.<br /> Persuasion: 2.<br /> Intimidation: 4.<br /> Origin: Genotypal.<br /> Clade: Chimerics.<br /> Scars and Variations:<br /> Tribulation: 3.<br /> Lash (Ranged, Athletics, Quick, Blasting, Reach, Piercing, Disabling): 3.<br /> <br /> Lying Eyes: 4.<br /> Rapid Healing (using 1 scar-free of subtle, the rest is paid for): 5.<br /> <br /> Conspicuous Appearance: 5.<br /> Superhuman Strength: 5.<br /> <br /> Subliminal Conditioning (Desire to kill Son Goku): 3.<br /> Flight: 3.<br /> <br /> Misfortune (Cursed): 3.<br /> Enhanced Speed (Guerilla): 3.<br /> <br /> Murderous Urge: 3.<br /> Anomalous Biology (Ageless, Tireless, Breathless, Hungerless): 3.<br /> <br /> Conviction (Son Goku, Son Gohan, Tien Shinhan, The World): 4.<br /> Loyalty (Kermit the Frog): 1. Note: The loyalty part and that alone is based on DevilArtemis\u2019 series because Cell wasn\u2019t loyal to anyone in DBZ.<br /> Acclimation: 4.<br /> Note on acclimation: 1 point for each form (normal, semi-perfect, and perfect) and 1 extra point for the zenkai boost he got when he blew himself up.<br /> Martial Arts: 5.<br /> Stability: 9.<br /> Size: 5.<br /> Speed: 20 (40 when moving under own power).<br /> Initiative: 12.<br /> Defense: 12.<br /> Willpower: 8.<br /> Health: 10.<br /> Aspiration: Prove you\u2019re perfect to the world.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":23983,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23983-xela_nut","user":"xela_nut","date":". 05-26-2022, 10:18 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23983-xela_nut","name":"xela_nut","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23983_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"91"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-16T05:48:07-08:00","id":1503230,"title":"","content":"The serial killer from Faces analog horror <b>Slasher</b><br /> The tell paintings of the <b>victims</b><br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@urbanspook\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@urbanspook\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@urbanspook\" target=\"_blank\"> https://youtube.com/@urbanspook </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> \u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27472,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27472-phoenix853457","user":"Phoenix853457","date":". 02-16-2023, 06:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27472-phoenix853457","name":"Phoenix853457","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27472_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"67"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-16T09:13:05-08:00","id":1503243,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Phoenix853457</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/349384-think-of-fictional-characters-and-say-what-they-would-be-in-cofd?p=1503230#post1503230\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">More scps?</div> </div> </div> </div>The SCP-verse is essentially within the purview of Hunter, so most of the monsters/anomalies are mechanically modeled as Bluebook Horrors, Ephemeral Beings, Mysterious Places / Nests, Relics, sometimes mortals suffering from Supernatural Persistent Conditions and/or displaying Supernatural Merits, and such. But in more specific terms, here are a few examples of my headcanons:<br /> <br /> 682 (The Hard To Destroy Reptile) = Abyssal Entity or Lower Depths Entity. Perhaps an Idigam, or even something from the Strange Spheres.<br /> <br /> 173 (The Sculpture) = Pandoran of the Silent Mockery. Maybe a malfunctioning God-Machine Angel of the Destroyer Incarnation?<br /> <br /> 049 (The Plague Doctor) = Straight up a Mage or Genius who is obsessed with curing some kind of supernatural plague he cannot properly explain to regular people because of the Sleeping Curse or Jabir, or perhaps something even worse. Definitely Low Wisdom / Low Obligation.<br /> <br /> 073 &amp; 076 AKA Cain &amp; Abel = Miscellaneous Immortals like the ones from the 1ed supplement about Immortals such as the Blood-Bathers and Purified.<br /> <br /> 2273 (Alexei Belitrov), 2800 (Cactus Man), The Little Misters (Various Wondertainment Articles), 542 (Herr Chirurg), 1884-A &amp; 1884-B (Madame Rezarta and Her Amazing Palm Reader), 890 (Rocket Surgeon), and many many other Humanoid SCPs = Deviants<br /> <br /> 1867 (Lord Blackwood) = A Hunter from a Splinter Timeline, who has been transformed into a Cryptid and only incomplete records and broken relics of his mostly deleted adventures remain.<br /> <br /> 106 (The Old Man) = Rank 3 Spirit of Fear and Pain, or perhaps one of the Begotten who used to be a solider in WW1, named Lawrence. He went through his Devouring in the middle of the trench warfare, according to the &quot;The Young Man&quot; Tale.<br /> <br /> 093 (Red Sea Object) = Some kind of God-Machine Infrastructure in the form of an object that takes the user to various Splinter Timelines.<br /> <br /> 1981 (RONALD REAGAN CUT UP WHILE TALKING) = Leaked footage of a world-shard of the Prince of 100.000 Leaves<br /> <br /> Tufto's 001 AKA The Scarlet King = Ochema of an Exarch, most likely the Raptor or Ruin.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":4443,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","user":"GibberingEloquence","date":". 02-16-2023, 12:16 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","t